[CustomMessages]
WebViewRequired=Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime is missing. Setup will download and install it from Microsoft before installing PTTStella. An internet connection is required.
WebViewInstalling=Installing Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime. This may take a few minutes...
WebViewStartFailed=Could not start the WebView2 installer (error %1). PTTStella has not been installed or updated. Retry, or install WebView2 from https://developer.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/ first.
WebViewPrepareFailed=Could not prepare the WebView2 installer: %1. PTTStella has not been installed or updated. Download a fresh PTTStella installer and retry.
WebViewInstallFailed=WebView2 Runtime is still unavailable after its installer exited (code %1). Check your internet connection and Windows installation policies, then retry. PTTStella has not been installed or updated.
WebViewRestart=WebView2 requires a Windows restart. Restart Windows, then run PTTStella Setup again.
WebViewHashFailed=The embedded WebView2 bootstrapper failed its integrity check.
